## Summary: Raise Dead Clicky Feature — Session A Complete

I've fixed all critical and high-priority issues from the Grok review for the client side. Every grave overlay now opens correctly, Clicky chat is fully functional with preset dialogue, and the codebase is clean.

### **#6 CRITICAL: GraveOverlay Overlay Attachment** ✓
**Issue:** The `wrapper` div was created but never appended to the DOM, so no grave overlay ever displayed.  
**Fix:** Passed `wrapper` into `tryMountAppAndBuildHeader()` and corrected the DOM hierarchy: `panel.appendChild(content)` → `wrapper.appendChild(panel)` → `overlay.appendChild(wrapper)` → `gameContainer.appendChild(overlay)`. The overlay now opens on F-press, displays Clicky with compact header (48 px medal inline with title/years), and both RIP button click and Esc exit correctly.

### **#9, #10 (client), #11, #12, #15 Client Issues** ✓
Fixed across four files:

**api.ts:**
- On 401, retry session once automatically
- History sanitized: NFC-normalize, strip control chars, max 300 chars per message, trim, keep only 4 items
- SSE parsing handles `[DONE]` properly, skips blank lines, recovers from partial JSON
- Server errors mapped correctly: `limit`→`limit_reached`, `daily`→`daily_tired`, `blocked`→`off_topic`, `empty`→`empty`, `upstream`/`timeout`→`error`

**ClickyChat.ts (complete rewrite):**
- Sprite frames fixed: desktop 2× (94×184 px, sheet 376×184), mobile 1.5× (70.5×138, sheet 282×138)
- Opening sequence: surprised frame (1) + shake ±3 px for 400 ms
- Typewriter: word-by-word typing, skip on bubble click/Enter, full text on reduced-motion
- Echo line shown above speech bubble, displays `You: <last message>`
- Options fade in (opacity 0→1, 200 ms) only after typing finishes
- Input row: character counter, scrollIntoView on focus (mobile keyboard support), Ask button
- Questions left counter displays remaining quota and updates on each session call
- History capped at 4 items, both user taps and typed questions stored with assistant replies
- Error key mapping implemented; limit/daily disable input with appropriate placeholder text
- End-node logic: typed reply on end node shows `wake` options, not current node options
- Buttons min-height 40 px, touch-action manipulation
- Keyboard capture: Phaser disabled while overlay open; Esc still exits; WASD/F/Space don't trigger in input
- Timer cleanup in dispose

**typewriter.ts (simplified):**
- Just provides `setAriaLive(text)` for accessibility and `skip()` signal
- Actual word-by-word animation handled in ClickyChat

**presets.ts:**
- Variant randomization: if `pick_variant` starts with `"random"`, randomize; else use first
- Prevents infinite loops: single-reply nodes always return first reply

